Subject: [PATCH 33/47] Night-only glass set for the home-room glass sign and
 room hint text (day refine 3.2 unchanged)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Funning on 09a1b8e: at night the 出发去看海 glass button is too bright and milky.
- glass-sign.effect: params2.y = night weight; params3/4/5 multiply base alpha, rim, top highlight and tint base/rim colours. Defaults are identity, so weight 0 is the day shader exactly.
- GlassSign.ts: GLASS_SIGN_NIGHT (base alpha x0.45, dark warm tint .22/.15/.09, rim x0.45 slight chandelier warmth, top highlight off -> one thin rim), caption warm white 232/226/212 with dark warm 1.5 px outline + soft shadow, no white backing. Blended by uiNightWeight().
- RoomExploreOverlay.ts: 向左轻拖 / 推开门 hint outline goes dark warm at night (day 33,45,45,170 unchanged).
- tools/test_glass_sign_night.cjs (in run-suite): locks night params, day identity and WCAG caption-vs-outline >= 4.5.
